{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"(Note: Major and Minor properties are from the tables on page 219 of the DMG.)\n**The World Stone Chisel**\nHas all the properties of *Banner of the Krig Rune*\nAllows the bearer to set their intentions once per day, granting them advantage on one skill check of their choice until the next dawn.\nAt dawn each day, gains one major and one minor property until the next dawn.\n*Was given to Leaf but is currently unclaimed as Leaf won't be present for the final fight.*","created_at":"2020-08-21T01:21:47.973000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746177200801316935","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"**The Osssuary Key**\nAllows the bearer to cast the following spells:\n*Knock* 2 times per day\n*Arcane Lock* 2 times per day\n*Arcanist's Magic Aura* 1 time per day\n*Passwall* 2 times per day\n*Dimension Door* 1 time per day\n*Leomund's Secret Chest* 2 times per day\nUnlocks the Ossuary and the Lighthouse\n*Currently held by Kiln*","created_at":"2020-08-21T01:21:57.738000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746177241758826607","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"**The Calipers of Creation**\nAllows the bearer to cast the following spells:\n*Mending *at will\n*Immovable object* 2 times a day\n*Fabrication* 2 times a day.\n*Creation * 1 time per day\n*Tether Essence* 1 time per day.\n*Currently held by Vee*","created_at":"2020-08-21T01:22:04.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746177271831855187","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"**The Rosecutter**\nWhen the bearer kills a creature with it, they gain the powers of the creature for use in battle.\n(need full info about this still)\n*Was given to Wren but is currently unclaimed as she doesn't use swords*","created_at":"2020-08-21T01:22:33.778000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-21T01:22:49.928000Z","id":"746177392921411614","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"**Bigfoot's Boots **\nAllows the bearer to cast the following spells:\n*Blur *2 times per day\n*Blink *2 times per day\nAllows the bearer to take 2 reactions per round\nAt dawn each day, gains one major and one minor property until the next dawn.\n*Currently held by Viola*","created_at":"2020-08-21T01:22:56.745000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746177489252122807","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"**Fez of the Yeti**\nThe bearer can maintain concentration on 2 spells at once.\nThe bearer gains a +1 bonus to AC and a +2 bonus to INT.\nAt dawn each day, gains one major property until the next dawn.\n*Currently held by Web*","created_at":"2020-08-21T01:23:12.483000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746177555262079036","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"**The Warden's Shield**\nOnce per fight, the bearer can use an action to cause the following effect:\nYou summon spirits of order to restore balance around you. You summon the spirits in a 30-foot cube originating from you. The spirits look like Tinkerbot. The spirits are intangible and invulnerable, work fast and efficiently, and create the following effects within the cube before vanishing:\n• The spirits restore up to 100 hit points, divided as you choose among any number of creatures of your choice in the cube.\n• Any damaged objects entirely in the cube are repaired.\nThe Warden's shield otherwise functions as an *animated shield*, granting a +2 to AC without needing to be held. Proficiency with shields is not required to wield it.\n*Currently unclaimed, though both lucky and Selene have expressed interest*","created_at":"2020-08-21T01:23:49.124000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746177708945309717","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"**Torch of Colombia**\nOnce per day, the torch may be used to cast a modified version of the spell *Spiritual Weapon*. As a bonus action, you create a spectral form of one of the cryptids identified by the masons on Roanoke Island (the Ozark Howler, the Pukwudgie, the Mothman, the Tazlewurm, or the Wendigo). When you create the spectral form, choose one of the chosen creature’s attacks. When the form is created, it makes the chosen attack against an enemy within 5 feet of it. As a bonus action in the next minute, you may move the spectral form up to 20 ft and repeat the attack against a nearby enemy. After the creature has attacked 3 times it disappears.\n*Currently unclaimed*","created_at":"2020-08-21T01:24:13.768000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746177812309737513","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
